# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# M3 / M4 manuscript provenance (must override the blanket **/results/,
# **/tables/ and *.csv rules above -- later patterns win).
#
# M3 and M4 are submitted manuscripts whose stated contribution is
# reproducibility, yet the result artifacts backing every table and figure were
# untracked.  That allowed silent drift: the M4 topology-posterior columns were
# produced before the 2026-07-19 change to
# hydrosheaf/inference/topology_posterior.py and no longer reproduced.
# Directories must be re-included before their contents.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!M3/m3_age_benchmark/results/
!M3/m3_age_benchmark/results/**
!M3/m3_age_benchmark/tables/
!M3/m3_age_benchmark/tables/**
!M4/m4_topology_benchmark/results/
!M4/m4_topology_benchmark/results/**
!M4/m4_topology_benchmark/tables/
!M4/m4_topology_benchmark/tables/**
# Keep the bulky raw public-archive dumps out regardless.
M4/m4_topology_benchmark/results/public_archives/

# M8 prospectively locked benchmark artifacts are part of the scientific record;
# external simulator workspaces are reproducible scratch and must remain local.
M8/m8_calibration_benchmark/.simulator_workspaces/
!M8/m8_calibration_benchmark/manuscript/artifacts/
!M8/m8_calibration_benchmark/manuscript/artifacts/**
!M8/m8_calibration_benchmark/development/DEV-M8-FRONTIER-AL-20260728-01/**
!M8/m8_calibration_benchmark/provenance/
!M8/m8_calibration_benchmark/provenance/**
